    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d174">

                <pb facs="0507" n="1137" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v2/pg1137"/>

                <head>No. 480.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. <persName corresp="#p_GHH1"
                            type="from">Heap</persName> to Mr. <persName corresp="#p_WH1" type="to"
                            >Hunter</persName>.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Consulate of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Tunis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-06-11"><hi rendition="#italic">June</hi> 11, 1873</date>.
                        (Received July 9.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 150.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: The Bey has notified me officially in
                    writing that the four persons apprehended for the murder of Mahmood Sennen,
                    dragoman of the United States consular agent at Bizerta, have been tried and
                    sentenced.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><persName corresp="#p_GHH1">G. H. HEAP</persName>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
